+Added `id` to `Task` (set in `createTask`, kept by rename), `get(id)` to `TaskList`, and id lookup in
+`find` and so in every method that takes a title (`rename` checks duplicates against the found task).
+Tests added in `test/list.test.ts`; `npm test` passes. See dl-001.
